# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Request access to the function by completing this [form](https://parityqc.com/products/parity-twine-optimizer/free-trial).\n"
"- Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/parity-twine-optimizer/api-reference) for this quantum function.\n"
"- Try the [Solve the market split problem with the ParityQC Parity Twine Optimizer](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms) tutorial.\n"
"- Try the [Solve the Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model with the ParityQC Parity Twine Optimizer](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-sk) tutorial.\n"
"- Review the [Connectivity-aware Synthesis of Quantum Algorithms, Drier et al. (2025)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020) ArXiv preprint.\n"
"- Review the [functions overview](/guides/functions), includes cost per execution.\n"
"- Learn about [managed workflows](/guides/managed-workflows).\n"
"- Understand [resource units (RUs)](/guides/plans-overview#rus).\n"
"- Learn how to choose [problem sizes and compute profiles](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
"- Review the [IBM Quantum Platform plans](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Рекомендації\">\n"
"- Подай запит на доступ до функції, заповнивши цю [форму](https://parityqc.com/products/parity-twine-optimizer/free-trial).\n"
"- Перегляньте [довідник API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/parity-twine-optimizer/api-reference) для цієї квантової функції.\n"
"- Спробуй навчальний матеріал [Solve the market split problem with the ParityQC Parity Twine Optimizer](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms).\n"
"- Спробуй навчальний матеріал [Solve the Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model with the ParityQC Parity Twine Optimizer](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-sk).\n"
"- Перегляньте препринт ArXiv [Connectivity-aware Synthesis of Quantum Algorithms, Drier et al. (2025)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.14020).\n"
"- Перегляньте [огляд функцій](/guides/functions), що включає вартість за виконання.\n"
"- Дізнайся про [кероване робочі процеси](/guides/managed-workflows).\n"
"- Зрозумій [одиниці ресурсів (RU)](/guides/plans-overview#rus).\n"
"- Дізнайся, як вибирати [розміри задач і обчислювальні профілі](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
"- Перегляньте [плани IBM Quantum Platform](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
